%% 4) PHASE A - He PURGE + LEAK-CHECK LIMITS =============================
% Vent open -> SWEEP purge: He flows in, mixed gas flows out through the vent.
% Perfect mixing: c = c0 * exp(-N), N = tank volumes of He flushed through.
% Pressure purge (vent capped): each cycle c -> c * (p_low/p_high).
